    <string name="privacy_body">AmaSilamsi ayabuhlonipha ubumfihlo bakho kwaye ayiqokeleli idatha yakho.\n\n• Akukho mkhondo: akukho SDKs zentengiso, uhlalutyo okanye iitraki zokuthengisa.\n• Idata ihlala kwisixhobo sakho: yonke idatha yakho (indawo, iisetingi, iibhukhimakhi) zigcinwa kwisixhobo sakho kuphela.\n• Indawo isetyenziswa ekuhlaleni: ulungelelwaniso lwakho lusetyenziselwa ukubala amaxesha omthandazo kunye neqibla kwisixhobo sakho, kwaye azithunyelwa kuyo nayiphi na iseva yangaphandle.\n• Iimvume kuphela xa zifuneka: sicela iimvume (indawo, izaziso) kuphela xa ifitsha lizifuna ngokwenene, ngengcaciso ecacileyo.\n• Akukho nxibelelwano lunyanzelweyo: i-app isebenza ngaphandle kweintanethi; usetyenziso lwenethiwekhi luyinketho ngokupheleleyo kwizinto ezongeziweyo ezinjengokukhuphela izicengcelezo.\n\nLo mgaqo-nkqubo uyinxalenye yovimba womthombo ovulelekileyo kwaye uvulelekile kuhlaziyo loluntu.</string>
